<!--
    Override widget icon sizes for all Edge devices.

    Sizing is based on screen height rather than screen width, as used for round watch devices.
    This ensures consistent scaling on both tall devices (for example 1050) and short devices
    (for example 850).

    Since the icons are not square, each icon must be sized individually.
    The relative proportions between the icons therefore differ from the layout
    used on round screens where scaling is based on width.
-->
